<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>404 Not Found - ryopc.org</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg: #f5f7fb;
            --card: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.88);
            --ink: #1e293b;
            --muted: #64748b;
            --line: rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.2);
            --primary: #007bff;
            --primary-strong: #005fd1;
            --accent: #7dd3fc;
            --glow: rgba(0, 123, 255, 0.14);
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        html, body {
            margin: 0;
            min-height: 100%;
            font-family: "Inter", "Noto Sans JP", sans-serif;
            background:
                radial-gradient(circle at top left, rgba(125, 211, 252, 0.32), transparent 28%),
                radial-gradient(circle at bottom right, rgba(0, 123, 255, 0.18), transparent 30%),
                var(--bg);
            color: var(--ink);
        }

        body {
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: grid;
            place-items: center;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .scene {
            position: relative;
            width: min(760px, calc(100vw - 2rem));
            padding: 2rem;
        }

        .orbit {
            position: absolute;
            inset: 10% 8% auto auto;
            width: 220px;
            height: 220px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(0, 123, 255, 0.18);
            border-radius: 50%;
            animation: drift 16s linear infinite;
        }

        .orbit::before,
        .orbit::after {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            width: 12px;
            height: 12px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--accent));
            box-shadow: 0 0 18px rgba(0, 123, 255, 0.4);
        }

        .orbit::before {
            top: 18px;
            left: 44px;
        }

        .orbit::after {
            right: 24px;
            bottom: 18px;
        }

        .card {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
            background: var(--card);
            border: 1px solid var(--line);
            border-radius: 32px;
            box-shadow: 0 30px 60px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            padding: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.5rem);
            text-align: center;
        }

        .badge {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            padding: 0.5rem 0.9rem;
            border-radius: 999px;
            background: rgba(125, 211, 252, 0.12);
            border: 1px solid rgba(0, 123, 255, 0.15);
            color: var(--primary-strong);
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 0.08em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .badge .dot {
            width: 8px;
            height: 8px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: #22c55e;
            box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.8);
            animation: pulse 1.8s ease-in-out infinite;
        }

        .error-code {
            margin: 1.25rem 0 0.5rem;
            font-size: clamp(5rem, 12vw, 9rem);
            font-weight: 900;
            letter-spacing: -0.08em;
            line-height: 0.9;
            color: transparent;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #10b7ff 0%, #007bff 45%, #3b82f6 100%);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            background-clip: text;
            text-shadow: 0 12px 28px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.18);
        }

        .title {
            margin: 0 0 0.9rem;
            font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
            letter-spacing: -0.05em;
        }

        .message {
            max-width: 540px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 1.04rem;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }

        .message strong {
            color: var(--ink);
        }

        .actions {
            margin-top: 2rem;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 1rem;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .btn {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            min-width: 160px;
            padding: 0.9rem 1.35rem;
            border-radius: 14px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 700;
            transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease, background 0.2s ease;
        }

        .btn:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        .btn-primary {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--primary-strong));
            color: white;
            box-shadow: 0 12px 24px rgba(0, 123, 255, 0.18);
        }

        .btn-secondary {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
            color: var(--ink);
            border: 1px solid rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.1);
        }

        .meta {
            margin-top: 2rem;
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 0.92rem;
        }

        .meta a {
            color: var(--primary-strong);
            text-decoration: none;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0, 123, 255, 0.3);
        }

        @keyframes drift {
            0% { transform: rotate(0deg) translateY(0px); }
            50% { transform: rotate(180deg) translateY(10px); }
            100% { transform: rotate(360deg) translateY(0px); }
        }

        @keyframes pulse {
            0%, 100% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 1; }
            50% { transform: scale(1.15); opacity: 0.8; }
        }

        @media (max-width: 640px) {
            .scene {
                width: min(100vw - 1rem, 520px);
                padding: 0.75rem;
            }

            .actions {
                flex-direction: column;
            }

            .btn {
                width: 100%;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="scene" aria-live="polite">
        <div class="orbit" aria-hidden="true"></div>

        <main class="card">
            <div class="badge"><span class="dot"></span> Lost in transit</div>
            <div class="error-code">404</div>
            <h1 class="title">このページは別の場所へ旅立ってしまいました。</h1>
            <p class="message">
                <strong>お探しのURL</strong>は存在しないか、移動・削除された可能性があります。<br>
                でも心配しないでください。ホームに戻れば、きっと次の一歩を見つけられます。
            </p>

            <div class="actions">
                <a href="/" class="btn btn-primary">ホームへ戻る</a>
                <a href="/docs/" class="btn btn-secondary">ドキュメントを見る</a>
            </div>

            <p class="meta">
                それでも見つからない場合は、<a href="https://fo.ryopc.org/">サポート</a>へどうぞ。
            </p>
        </main>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
